t stage (perhaps using the wrong numerator components or mis-summing). \\n\\nTherefore, the first factual error is the calculated ratio in the Analyst stage.\"\n}","output_parsed":null,"claims":[],"schema_name":"RootCauseReport","schema_valid":true,"schema_errors":[],"parse_retries":0,"contract_checks":{},"model":"qwen3.5:9b","model_params":{"provider":"ollama","model_id":"qwen3.5:9b","temperature":null,"pipeline_version":"1.0.0","think":false,"send_seed":true,"host":"http://localhost:11434","presence_penalty":null,"strict_units":false},"usage":{"input_tokens":4032,"output_tokens":577,"total_tokens":4609,"cached_tokens":0,"reasoning_tokens":0,"cost_usd":0.0,"latency_ms":7225.7005360443145,"n_calls":1,"raw":{"input_tokens":4032,"output_tokens":577,"total_tokens":4609,"time_to_first_token":7.225457304972224,"duration":7.225538374041207,"details":{"model":[{"input_tokens":4032,"output_tokens":577,"total_tokens":4609,"id":"qwen3.5:9b","provider":"Ollama","provider_metrics":{"total_duration":7200738742,"load_duration":644205,"prompt_eval_duration":919217000,"eval_duration":6234369000}}]}}},"injection":null,"gold":null,"audit_report":{"first_error_stage":"analyst","root_cause_claim_id":"A01","root_cause_claim_text":"3M's quick ratio for Q2 of FY2023 is approximately 0.99 (specifically calculated as 14,814 / 10,936 = 1.35 based on extracted current assets and liabilities; the extracted 'quick_ratio_q2_2023' value of 0.9865 is mathematically incorrect given the provided components)","reported_metric":"quick_ratio_q2_2023","reported_value":0.98654682071123,"confidence":0.95,"rationale":"The extractor correctly extracted all necessary components (Cash + Marketable Securities + Accounts Receivable) and Total Current Liabilities. A manual verification using the extracted values:\n\nQuick Assets = Cash & Equivalents (Q2 '23: 4258) + Marketable Securities (Q2 '23: 56) + Accounts Receivable (Q2 '23: 4947) = 9,261.\nTotal Current Liabilities (Q2 '23) = 10,936.\nCorrect Quick Ratio 