t A01 is 0.9865... This is significantly different from 0.8468. The discrepancy suggests a calculation error in the Analyst stage (perhaps using the wrong numerator components or mis-summing). \n\nTherefore, the first factual error is the calculated ratio in the Analyst stage."},"notes":{}}
